    skos:definition 'An acoustic transmitter made of PZT material comprising a forest of narrow longitudinal rods embedded in a polymer, which combines high coupling with relatively low acoustic impedance.  Desgned to to incorporated into acoustic rolling contact core profilers.'@en ;
