    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'high performance liquid chromatography - electrospray ionisation quadrupole mass spectrometry'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A chromatographic technique for separating and analysing mixtures of substances, using a packed column containing microspheres coated with the stationary phase and where the mobile phase is pumped through the column with a high pressure pump. The emergence of each component of the sample under analysis from the column is monitored using a mass spectrometer with an ionisation technique suited to biological samples..'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:S04::S041047'^^xsd:string .
